      "id": 1,
      "text": "Lo Prado became an autonomous commune on March 17, 1981, after the military government split Pudahuel into three new municipalities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        8,
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
